# Azure Voice Live
AZURE_VOICELIVE_ENDPOINT="https://<resource-name>.services.ai.azure.com/"
AZURE_VOICELIVE_MODEL="gpt-4o-realtime-preview"
AZURE_VOICELIVE_VOICE="alloy"

# Camera vision analysis
# Set this to a deployed multimodal model that accepts image input.
AZURE_VISION_ENDPOINT="https://<resource-name>.services.ai.azure.com/"
AZURE_VISION_MODEL="phi-4-multimodal-instruct"

# Assistant behavior
ASSISTANT_INSTRUCTIONS="你是运行在 Windows 电脑上的个人语音助手。你可以通过工具调用控制这台电脑的设备设置（例如音量）。当用户请求调整音量/静音时，优先调用工具；完成后用中文简短确认，并给出当前音量。"
